# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT — CIVICGRID
## Smart Public Works Transparency, Citizen Engagement & Interdepartmental Coordination Platform

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, product designer, geospatial systems engineer, and software architect. Build a production-quality CivicTech web application called **CivicGrid** that improves transparency, accountability, citizen engagement, and coordination in municipal public works.

Do not build just a static UI prototype. Build a functional, responsive, full-stack application with a working database, realistic seed data, interactive maps, dashboards, authentication, role-based access, APIs, and end-to-end workflows.

