DigSync is the main operational differentiator of CivicGrid.

Its purpose is to prevent repeated excavation, overlapping road closures, and avoidable conflicts between municipal departments.

Departments may include:

- Water supply.
- Drainage and sewerage.
- Electricity.
- Telecommunications.
- Roads and highways.
- Gas utilities.
- Other municipal services.

## 7.1 Unified project registry

