Required fields include:

- Project ID.
- Department.
- Work category.
- Project geometry or affected road segment.
- Planned start and completion dates.
- Estimated duration.
- Work status.
- Excavation required: yes/no.
- Affected lanes or road segments.
- Dependencies.
- Priority.
- Authorized contact.
- Project description.

Enforce role-based access so that departments can manage their own projects while municipal coordinators can view and coordinate projects across departments.

## 7.2 Spatial and temporal conflict detection

